      "content": "i know there are people but it doesnt feel real. like i'm just playing a part in a movie. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the person looking back. he was my mirror. he was the one who made me real. without him, i'm just a shell. i just feel so disconnected from everything. does that even make sense? how am i supposed to just... exist? like this?",
